 "notes": "Statement: IATI 2021 senior day 1 task 1 (Heaps), arena.olimpiici.com problem 1606 (PDF). No accepted submission exists (the 16 C++ ones are WA, RTE or TLE; 5052334 XORs B + S, wrong already for K = 0). orig.cpp computes transfinite Grundy values w c + d: g(b, s) = (b, s - K b) for s >= K b, else the K = 1 table scaled by K, the table built from the rows above it; a brute of the definition (exact prefix-plus-tail rows) agrees on every pair of heaps with b <= 24, s <= 30 for K = 0..4, and it prints the statement example."
